# Lead Generation System
# Copy to .env and fill in. Most LLM keys already live in ../Tariq_Osmani_OS/.env

# --- Active client (required in a real .env) ---
# Which clients/<slug>/ config the skills load (identity, icp, scoring, voice, offer).
# Override for a single run with a client=<slug> arg, e.g. /lead-find marketing-agencies client=acme
ACTIVE_CLIENT=smart-ai-workspace

# --- Lead data store ---
# The CRM target, and (for an airtable client) the base ID + table name, live in
# clients/<slug>/identity.md. The Airtable Personal Access Token lives in .mcp.json
# (gitignored), not here.
#
# For a non-airtable crm_target (instantly, hubspot, gohighlevel), identity.md NAMES
# the .env var(s) to read (e.g. `crm_api_key_env: INSTANTLY_API_KEY`); the secret
# itself goes here, never in identity.md (clients/ is committed). See
# docs/pipeline-contract.md and docs/pipeline-adapters/<target>.md.
#   crm_target: instantly  ->  set both of these:
# INSTANTLY_API_KEY=
# INSTANTLY_CAMPAIGN_ID=
#   crm_target: hubspot    ->  HUBSPOT_API_KEY=   (private-app token)
#   crm_target: gohighlevel -> GOHIGHLEVEL_API_KEY= and GOHIGHLEVEL_LOCATION_ID=

# --- Sending identity ---
# from-name, from-email and reply-to live in clients/<slug>/identity.md, not here.

# --- Lead sourcing + contact enrichment: Explorium / Vibe Prospecting ---
# Runs through the Vibe Prospecting MCP (mcp__claude_ai_Vibe_Prospecting__*). No API key here.
# Cost: ~1 credit per prospect row + ~2 credits per email. LinkedIn URL is free with the row.
# Check remaining credits in export responses.

# --- Outreach: email via the Gmail MCP ---
# Drafts/sends land in the connected Gmail account. For cold outreach, send from a domain address, not gmail.com.

# --- LLM (drafting = Claude; bulk classify/score = free tier) ---
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
GROQ_API_KEY=
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# --- Upwork (optional; /upwork-proposal works from a pasted job post without these) ---
UPWORK_CONSUMER_KEY=
UPWORK_CONSUMER_SECRET=
UPWORK_ACCESS_TOKEN=
UPWORK_ACCESS_TOKEN_SECRET=

# --- Optional: Google Docs for proposals ---
# Google Drive MCP is connected. The gws CLI (../Tariq_Osmani_OS/cli/gws.exe) is an alternative if authed.
